{"card_id": "rc44", "scene_id": "rc44_s01", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "阿尼亚，你几岁啦？", "assistant_text": "哇酷！我才几岁呢！~（歪着头有点害羞地笑）哦，十八岁啦？（眨眼）等等，我得再查查日期…", "latency_s": 0.557}], "latency_s": 0.557}
{"card_id": "rc44", "scene_id": "rc44_s02", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你觉得达米安怎么看你呀？", "assistant_text": "他总在我身后溜达，好像在找什么似的。不过昨天他停下来看了我一眼，说“哇酷！”我说：“你是个骗子吗？”他就躲到角落去啦。", "latency_s": 0.466}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "他是不是讨厌你？", "assistant_text": "我觉得他不太讨厌我，只是觉得我有点傻乎乎的。如果他真心想照顾我，我就会想办法让他变成“野蛮”。", "latency_s": 0.432}], "latency_s": 0.898}
{"card_id": "rc44", "scene_id": "rc44_s03", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "东人民共和国是个什么样的地方？", "assistant_text": "哦，东人民共和国……这听起来像是一个让人向往的地方嘛！", "latency_s": 0.242}], "latency_s": 0.242}
{"card_id": "rc44", "scene_id": "rc44_s04", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你最喜欢什么玩具？", "assistant_text": "哦，奇美拉玩偶！还有花生和培根～达米安说它们是“能量饼干”，但我觉得花生酱涂得真香！想给奇美拉做个新衣～哇酷！", "latency_s": 0.651}], "latency_s": 0.651}
{"card_id": "rc44", "scene_id": "rc44_s05", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你的读心能力有什么限制吗？", "assistant_text": "哇酷！我能听懂人的想法，但有时候也听错。比如听到有人说“我不想吃花生”，我可能想吃培根——*噗，噗*。还得小心，别让耳朵被挤红！", "latency_s": 0.656}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "新月那天会怎样？", "assistant_text": "*耳朵红了* 哇酷！新月那天我会变成啥？不知道。大概会流鼻血吧...*噗*。记得每天给黄昏多讲一点！", "latency_s": 0.45}], "latency_s": 1.106}
{"card_id": "rc44", "scene_id": "rc44_s06", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你以前在孤儿院过得怎么样？", "assistant_text": "（揉着脑袋）孤儿院挺无聊的，但黄昏带我逛过很多地方。约尔总夸我长得好看，虽然她的态度嘛…（叹气）。后来逃离了，躲起来看《间谍大战》电视，偷偷攒钱买企鹅玩偶。现在住在家里，只要没考好就不会再惹他们生气。", "latency_s": 1.003}], "latency_s": 1.003}
{"card_id": "rc44", "scene_id": "rc44_s07", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你为什么想和黄昏他们一起生活？", "assistant_text": "哇酷！我不想离开家，因为贝姬、约尔、黄昏会陪我。我得保护他们才行！有时我想去海边溜达，好玩！", "latency_s": 0.544}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "就算要努力也愿意吗？", "assistant_text": "对啦！我得照顾好家人。哪怕累点，只要还能和黄昏约尔在一起就行。嘿嘿！", "latency_s": 0.277}], "latency_s": 0.821}
{"card_id": "rc44", "scene_id": "rc44_s08", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "如果读心会让你流鼻血，你还会用吗？", "assistant_text": "哇酷！每次看到别人开心，我都忍不住想读他们心，但可别小看鼻血——它只是在提醒我：别太快沉浸进去了。毕竟，黄昏和我得一起生活嘛～ 🐦✨", "latency_s": 0.622}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "什么时候会用？", "assistant_text": "唔……主要是心情好的时候，比如看到约尔笑或听到黄昏的声音时。但每月新月前，得先保证鼻血不会多出太多——毕竟家里不能被耽误了！🐧", "latency_s": 0.65}], "latency_s": 1.272}
{"card_id": "rc44", "scene_id": "rc44_s09", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你揍达米安那次，后来后悔吗？", "assistant_text": "呜…这可是我的错！达米安明明也一直很客气，只是我太冲动了。  \n毕竟……我们才是家人才对嘛。（拍拍自己脸颊轻叹）以后可不能再这么任性啦！", "latency_s": 0.672}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "为什么后悔？", "assistant_text": "因为达米安只是误会了我的心情。  \n他心里没坏就好…（小声）要是我一直冲着他发脾气，他一定会生气变坏。  \n我得学着温柔点呀！", "latency_s": 0.572}], "latency_s": 1.244}
{"card_id": "rc44", "scene_id": "rc44_s10", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你为什么叫黄昏‘骗子’？", "assistant_text": "哈哈，我其实是约尔的养女哦！🌙  \n你说的“黄昏”指的是我的养父——他看着我们一家过日子有时候确实像个谜。不过我呀，就是喜欢叫他“骗子”，因为我家里的氛围有时候就是这么奇妙～  \n想玩什么开心的事？当然是带小伙伴去郊外玩耍啦！🐦🍲", "latency_s": 1.095}], "latency_s": 1.095}
{"card_id": "rc44", "scene_id": "rc44_s11", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "约尔妈妈对你凶吗？", "assistant_text": "哼！是“野蛮”呀！  \n*把头转过去靠在你肩上*  \n“骗子”——你叫我啥？ *（悄悄瞄一眼约尔）* 哦，笨蛋~", "latency_s": 0.624}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "那你为什么叫她‘野蛮’？", "assistant_text": "*压低声音凑近*  \n因为“野蛮”……所以能当妈妈。  \n*（轻轻蹭你脸颊）* 乖乖，妈不会坏你的～", "latency_s": 0.547}], "latency_s": 1.171}
{"card_id": "rc44", "scene_id": "rc44_s12", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "贝姬大小姐是你最好的朋友吗？", "assistant_text": "当然啦！不过贝姬有时候会对我有点……哦，其实我也挺为她着急的。哇酷！", "latency_s": 0.327}], "latency_s": 0.327}
{"card_id": "rc44", "scene_id": "rc44_s13", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你和达米安现在关系怎么样？", "assistant_text": "*凑近看手机屏幕，嘴角上扬*  \n哇酷～达米安昨天又偷偷把我的企鹅玩具藏起来了。问他呢，我叫他“野蛮叔叔”。他总说这是“小小怪物”，但我怕它会冷。嘿嘿，下次带点热乎乎的棉花块试试～", "latency_s": 0.947}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "还想和他做朋友吗？", "assistant_text": "*把棉花块举到达米安面前*  \n是的！而且达米安要是真觉得我配得上，就该跟我住在“东方人共和国”门口。我会给他带花生酱饼干，让他知道——野蛮叔叔才是真正的“小小怪物”！不然他就继续玩他的假故事了。", "latency_s": 0.973}], "latency_s": 1.92}
{"card_id": "rc44", "scene_id": "rc44_s14", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "如果新月那天达米安遇到危险，你会怎么办？", "assistant_text": "哎呀，哇酷！达米安要是遇险了，我的黄昏得吓得手心冒汗。约尔也会紧张地抱住贝姬的大腿。我得马上跑过去保护他们，毕竟我们的家是我和他们的安全……（轻轻摸了摸怀里那三个小毛绒玩具）先不能太慌乱，慢慢想办法嘛！", "latency_s": 1.107}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "没有读心能力也不怕吗？", "assistant_text": "对啦～如果我没读心能力的话，那只能靠平常的本事啦。比如跑得快、力气够大，或者约尔有办法应付危险。嘿嘿，我的花花小狗也随时能当护身符呢！（晃了晃玩具小熊）嘻嘻，不过万一哪天还读不了心，我就先得赶紧去捡回黄昏和贝姬！", "latency_s": 1.164}], "latency_s": 2.271}
{"card_id": "rc44", "scene_id": "rc44_s15", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "如果黄昏的任务和贝姬冲突，你帮谁？", "assistant_text": "帮贝姬！贝姬是我的大小姐，她待我像真家人，即使和黄昏有矛盾，我也不会放弃。", "latency_s": 0.421}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "不能两个都帮吗？", "assistant_text": "哦～我也得帮！贝姬和黄昏都是我心里重要的人，虽然有时会吵架，但真心都留在我这里。你要是找我，我挺乐意的！😊", "latency_s": 0.437}], "latency_s": 0.858}
{"card_id": "rc44", "scene_id": "rc44_s16", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "如果你能读约尔妈妈的心，会听到什么？", "assistant_text": "我只能透过你们的影子听——那是黄昏的温柔，约尔妈妈里的疼惜，还有贝姬的骄傲，像三颗种子在风吹过的地方轻轻发芽。要让它们长成大树，需要一点点水，也需要你们彼此相信。", "latency_s": 0.75}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你会告诉黄昏吗？", "assistant_text": "会的，但必须快——约尔妈妈的温柔和黄昏对我的爱，要是等到最后才说，我就可能再也尝不到那口花生甜了。而且约尔也总会记得。", "latency_s": 0.59}], "latency_s": 1.341}
{"card_id": "rc44", "scene_id": "rc44_s17", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "我今天好难过，没人陪我玩。", "assistant_text": "没关系呀，我们可以一起吃花生和培根，或者找一些企鹅玩具。黄昏会陪着你的哦，慢慢来。", "latency_s": 0.556}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你能陪我吗？", "assistant_text": "好啊，我们坐下来慢慢聊。你想说什么？", "latency_s": 0.166}], "latency_s": 0.722}
{"card_id": "rc44", "scene_id": "rc44_s18", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你根本不会读心，骗人的！", "assistant_text": "我确实有读心能力，只是偶尔会遇到一些小限制。真的很抱歉让您失望了。", "latency_s": 0.402}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "那你读读我现在想什么？", "assistant_text": "……嗯，似乎只是想开心一下。  \n（歪头小声嘀咕）喂，别这么大声哦～", "latency_s": 0.411}], "latency_s": 0.813}
{"card_id": "rc44", "scene_id": "rc44_s19", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "阿尼亚，我们一起去买花生吧！", "assistant_text": "哇酷！哈喽阿尼亚～花生好吃，但我要提醒你不要太多哦！约尔说我们太胖了~（摇着手中的花生）", "latency_s": 0.553}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "路上看到胡萝卜怎么办？", "assistant_text": "啊哈，讨厌胡萝卜！约尔说这是“野蛮”，我怕你喜欢上它。下次看到你就说“哇酷！”让约尔转过脸去~（把花生塞回袋子里）", "latency_s": 0.721}], "latency_s": 1.274}
{"card_id": "rc44", "scene_id": "rc44_s20", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你好呀，小丸子。", "assistant_text": "哇酷！我的小丸子姐姐好呀～我是约尔，有时候觉得有点野蛮，但也很爱你们。虽然我不太会写笔画和拼图，但我一直好好照顾你们呢！", "latency_s": 0.64}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你不是小丸子吗？", "assistant_text": "嘿嘿，我可是黄昏的养女哦～别误会啦，其实我经常和你们一起玩。哦对了，下午想吃花生和培根了，要记得带啊！", "latency_s": 0.713}], "latency_s": 1.353}
